# Line endings, independent of each clone's core.autocrlf: LF in the repository and on
# checkout — shell scripts with CRLF fail (`set -o pipefail\r`) — except Windows batch files,
# which need CRLF: cmd mis-parses labels (goto / call :label) in LF-only .bat files.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
